      "description": "Entries past the relay's retry ceiling. Nothing retries them and nothing deletes them, so this only goes up until a human acts — a step here is a permanent thing, not a rate. It is also the honest quarantine number: the broker moves a message to <queue>.quarantine on x-delivery-limit without telling the adapter, so there is no consumer-side count to compare it against.",
