      "description": "Accepted is counted after the broker acknowledges, refused in the failure arm — so a publish appears in exactly one of them. A refusal is the relay's problem, not a consumer's: the entry stays in the outbox and is retried until the ceiling, which is what the quarantine panel above ends up showing.",
